rooms_desc ({"This is the entrance to Ned's place.  Nothing fancy, but youfeel at home here.  You know that you are always welcome to come back.","This is where Ned keeps all his junk.  There are manuals andboards all over the place.  In one corner is the Commodore 64and Atari 800 for nostalgia and cool games.  In the other corneris the Vax and Sun Sparcstation 2.  You wonder what they are for.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
